MainWindow.pmExitButtonLogout = Logout
MainWindow.pmExitButtonExit = Exit
MainWindow.lbTips = TIPS\n\n1. Paste the promo message to ALL CHAT and get 10 extra rating. The message is auto copied when the game starts, you just need to paste it.\n2. Only 5x5 games in Garena, iCCup, RGC, DLG and Battle.net count\n3. Always run Warcraft III through the platform itself ("Start Game" button in Garena, etc)
MainWindow.lbHowItWorks = HOW IT WORKS\n\n1. Run the client and login with your Darer account.\n2. Go to Battle.net, Garena, iCCup, DLG or RGC and start a game in the normal way.\n3. When the game starts paste the promo message and you will get the 10 extra rating for that game.\n4. After the game, go to www.darer.com to check your statistics, or click here.

#MainWindow.btSettings = Settings
#MainWindow.btLogout = Logout

